[metadata]
Name:Rules pilot 283 - The umbra'd creature is not destroyed
Goal:Survive
Turns:1
Difficulty:Medium
Description:You have Naturalize and Decree of Pain in hand and {B}{B}{B}{G} plus seven {C} in your mana pool. The opponent controls Raptor Companion enchanted with Eland Umbra, and Grizzly Bears. End the turn having drawn exactly two cards (three left in your library) with Raptor Companion in the opponent's graveyard.
Rule:rulesguru-ed6832ad42fd86f6 | Umbra armor replaces the creature's destruction with the Aura's (CR 702.89a), so the creature is not "destroyed this way" and Decree of Pain draws nothing for it: destroy Eland Umbra first, then cast Decree for two cards
